"My progress: an enemy you met shows its name, picture and places; one you "
"defeated its numbers, weaknesses, drops and attacks. Battles are recorded "
"in either mode."
msgstr ""
"Mes progrès : un ennemi que vous avez rencontré montre son nom, son image "
"et ses lieux ; un ennemi que vous avez vaincu son nombre, ses faiblesses, "
"ses chutes et ses attaques."

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid "Whose progress"
msgstr "Dont progrès"

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid ""
"Each game keeps its own record, by the id its saves carry from their first "
"save on. Games saved before ids existed share one record."
msgstr ""
"Chaque jeu conserve son propre record, par l'id ses sauvegardes portent de "
"leur premier sauvegarde. Jeux enregistrés avant les ids existaient partager "
"un record."

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid "This game"
msgstr "Ce jeu"

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid "Games saved before ids (the shared record)"
msgstr "Jeux enregistrés avant les ids (l'enregistrement partagé)"

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid "Read the memory cards"
msgstr "Lire les cartes mémoire"

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid "No Xenogears saves on the memory cards"
msgstr "Aucun Xenogears n'enregistre sur les cartes mémoire"

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Slot %d: %s (%s, story %d)"
msgstr "Fente %d : %s ( %s , histoire %d )"

