msgid "Cancel the carry-over"
msgstr "Annuler le report"

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid "No record carries into the next new game"
msgstr "Aucun disque n'entre dans le prochain nouveau jeu"

#: port/src/extras/bestiary.cpp
msgid "Start over"
msgstr "Recommencer"

